{
  "_comment": [
    "Every third-party binary this application bundles, pinned by SHA-256.",
    "",
    "Upstream ships these from a 'Win_Binaries' release tag with no version numbers,",
    "no upstream URLs and no checksums, so a user cannot tell what is inside the app.",
    "This fork fetches each tool from its own official project instead and refuses to",
    "build if a download does not match the hash recorded here.",
    "",
    "A null sha256 means 'not pinned yet'. Run:  python tools/fetch_deps.py --update-lock",
    "once, check the hash it records against the publisher, then commit it. CI runs",
    "without --update-lock, so an unpinned or changed dependency fails the build."
